No open-source license has been selected for the application itself.
The app metadata therefore uses LicenseRef-proprietary.
This notice does not change the author's existing rights or grant a new code license.

The application uses third-party Rust crates under their respective licenses.
Their sources and license files are included in the source archive supplied with this release.
On Linux, GTK and the other runtime libraries are supplied by the GNOME Flatpak runtime.
On Windows, the included MSYS2 DLLs have notices under share/licenses. Their matching
source packages and build recipes accompany the installer in the windows-library-sources archive.
These libraries are dynamically linked and can be replaced with compatible versions.

The logo is a vector rendition of the book concept selected by the author.
